      "translations": {
        "en": "I entered upon Abu Al-Hasan Al-Rida (peace be upon him), along with Husayn ibn Thuwayr ibn Abu Fakhta, and I said to him, 'May I be your ransom, we used to be in a state of abundance in sustenance and youthfulness in life, but the condition changed somewhat. So supplicate to Allah, the Mighty and Majestic, to return that state to us.'"
      }
