      "translations": {
        "en": "He said, 'What do you want? Would it please you to be like Tahir and Harsama, and you are upon the opposite of what they are upon?' I said, 'No, by Allah, it would not please me that I have the world and whatever is in it of gold and silver, while I am upon the opposite of what I am upon (in terms of Wilayah/Imamate).'"
